{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "四種有機化合物甲、乙、丙、丁的分子量、偶極矩及沸點如下表所示：\n化合物 分子量 偶極矩（Debye） 沸點（℃）\n甲 44 2.7 21\n乙 44 0.1 -42\n丙 46 1.3 -25\n丁 46 1.69 78\n試問下列何者為甲、乙、丙、丁四種化合物的正確排列順序？", "options": {"A": "二甲醚，丙烷，乙醇，乙醛", "B": "丙烷，乙醛，二甲醚，乙醇", "C": "二甲醚，乙醇，乙醛，丙烷", "D": "乙醇，乙醛，丙烷，二甲醚", "E": "乙醛，丙烷，二甲醚，乙醇"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 68.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 8.0, "E": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 62.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 91.0, 77.0, 52.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "過錳酸鉀是強氧化劑，在酸性條件下，紫色的過錳酸鉀會被還原成幾近無色的\n錳(Ⅱ)離子。下列何者是在製備酸性過錳酸鉀溶液時，最常使用的酸？", "options": {"A": "HF", "B": "HNO", "C": "HClO", "D": "H SO", "E": "H S O\n3 4 2 4 2 2 3\n- 1 -\n100年指考 第 2 頁\n化學考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 59.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 83.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 38.0, "E": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 45.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 72.0, 54.0, 42.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
