{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪一選項中的各個化合物，溶於水後皆呈鹼性？", "options": {"A": "NH Cl、 Cu(NO ) 、 C H OH", "B": "NH Cl、 KCl、 NaHCO\n4 3 2 2 5 4 3", "C": "Cu(NO ) 、 NaF、 C H OH", "D": "NaF、 K CO 、 NaHCO\n3 2 2 5 2 3 3", "E": "KCl、 Cu(NO ) 、 K CO\n3 2 2 3"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 65.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 95.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 29.0, "E": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 66.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 89.0, 69.0, 44.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "奈米碳管的電子傳輸效果佳，可用於導電材料。有一奈米碳管，由 180 個碳原\n子組成，且其兩端皆封閉。若將一莫耳的碳－碳雙鍵進行氫化，會釋放出約\n80 仟卡的熱量。試問若將一個奈米 C 碳管完全氫化，產生 C H 的產物，約\n180 180 180\n可釋出多少卡的熱量？", "options": {"A": "10−23", "B": "10−20", "C": "10−17", "D": "103", "E": "106"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 23.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 74.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 15.0, "E": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 62.0, 50.0, 39.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "目前手機多以鋰離子電池作為電源，其中石墨為負極，進行充電時，需要 6\n莫耳碳與 1 莫耳鋰離子才能儲存 1 莫耳電子，反應式如下：\n6C + Li+ + e− (cid:3)(cid:1)(cid:1)(cid:1) 充(cid:1)(cid:1) 電(cid:1)(cid:2)(cid:1)(cid:1) LiC\n放電 6\n假設某一手機連續通話3.0小時後，其電能才會耗盡。若通話時的平均電流值\n為0.30安培，則該手機的鋰離子電池中至少約需幾克石墨（最接近的數值）？", "options": {"A": "14", "B": "2.4", "C": "1.5", "D": "0.24", "E": "0.15\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 100年指考\n共 7 頁 化學考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 23.0, "E": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 76.0, 58.0, 44.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在固定溫度與體積時，於密閉系統中進行下列反應且也達到平衡：\nH + I (cid:4) 2 HI\n2(g) 2(g) (g)\n若所有的氣體均符合理想氣體的條件，而加入少量的 Ar 使系統的總壓力增\n(g)\n大，則下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "加入 Ar 後，各反應物的濃度不變\n(g)", "B": "當再加入更多的 Ar 後，達到平衡時會產生更多的 HI\n(g) (g)", "C": "反應會向左進行而達到平衡", "D": "反應的平衡常數會變大", "E": "Ar 會參與反應\n(g)"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 76.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 96.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 50.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 93.0, 83.0, 67.0, 40.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-chemistry-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "今年（西元 2011 年 3 月 11 日）在日本東北地區發生芮氏規模 9.0 大地震，並\n引發大海嘯，導致福島核電廠受損，放射性物質碘-131 外洩。碘-131 放射強\n度的半衰期為 8 天。試問下列有關碘-131 的敘述，哪些正確？", "options": {"A": "碘-131在人體內，最容易累積在肺部", "B": "碘-131的原子核內，中子數比質子數多出25個", "C": "在化合物中的碘-131，加硝酸銀溶液使其產生沉澱，就可消除其放射性", "D": "碘-131經80天後，其放射性強度就減弱約為原來的千分之一", "E": "含有碘-131的氣體化合物，若不考慮氣流等影響，則該氣體分布範圍由1公\n里擴散至10公里時，其平均濃度會減成約為千分之一"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 32.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 84.0, "E": 57.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 93.0, "E": 65.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 45.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 72.0, "E": 56.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 61.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 49.0, 39.0, 32.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
